That repository was archived on 2026-08-06 and is no longer maintained. Its
maintainer invited the community to fork and continue development.

Portions of this project are derived from that work. Its complete history -
647 commits from 37 contributors, dating to 2020-01-10 - is preserved in this
repository on the `upstream` branch, so authorship of the original code remains
attributable via `git log` and `git blame`.

