CHANGES FROM THE ORIGINAL
-------------------------
Stated per section 4(b) of the Apache License, Version 2.0.

  - Source ported to current @actions/* and @octokit/* releases.
  - Build tooling replaced; lodash, node-fetch and actions-toolkit dropped.
  - Test coverage extended with signature-file round-trip fixtures.
  - Bot comments are marked "Contributor License bot" rather than "CLA/DCO
    Assistant Lite bot". The original markers are still recognised on read so
    that a repository migrating from the original transitions its existing
    comment in place. See SPEC.md section 7.

Behaviour is otherwise unchanged. v1 is a drop-in replacement and replicates the
original exactly, including known bugs; see SPEC.md. Any future divergence
will be opt-in and recorded there and in the release notes.
